npm run lint (which the .woodpecker/verify.yaml 'verify' step runs after
build, BEFORE typecheck/test) fails on PR #1012@9f6aaf4 with
@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars: 'Submission' is defined but never
used (v08-two-real-domain-apps-f01.test.ts:30) — eslint exit 1 gives the
generic 'Pipeline failed' seen in ci/woodpecker/pr/verify pipeline 1118;
the F01 tests never executed in CI. Locally F01 itself is green on Node
24/Windows (6/6). One-line zero-behavior removal; owner may adopt or
supersede on work/v08-tf-two-real-domain-apps.
